From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: gugu-acp <gugu-acp@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 04:52:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] gugu: mark a usage_update whose context window is still a
 guess

Why: a session's `size` is the name-based guess until the window is
authoritative, i.e. confirmed by the cross-session cache, a result's
modelUsage, or (since upstream 0.83) the background getContextUsage. Opus 5.5
has a native 1M window and ids without "1m", so the guess reads 200000. ACP
requires `size` to be a number, so the bridge cannot leave it out. Instead it
marks such an update with `_meta["_claude/contextWindowEstimated"]: true`, and
Gugu does not draw the guess as the session's limit (gugu#6552).

This replaces the earlier 0004, which also persisted confirmed windows in
$CLAUDE_AGENT_ACP_STATE_DIR so that a new adapter process would not start on
the guess. Upstream's background getContextUsage (0.83.0, #1186) now confirms
the window about 0.5 s after session creation on CLI 2.1.283+. The persistence
is therefore dropped; only the marker remains, keyed on upstream's own
`contextWindowAuthoritative`.

Upstream: none yet.

Drop when: upstream reports on usage_update whether `size` is confirmed.
---
 src/acp-agent.ts            | 11 +++--
 src/tests/acp-agent.test.ts | 90 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-
 2 files changed, 97 insertions(+), 4 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/acp-agent.ts b/src/acp-agent.ts
index f10c8b5..2d4c005 100644
--- a/src/acp-agent.ts
+++ b/src/acp-agent.ts
@@ -3770,7 +3770,10 @@ export class ClaudeAcpAgent {
     };
 
     // ACP's usage_update has no model field, so the model the usage belongs
-    // to rides in `_meta` alongside the other `_claude/*` keys.
+    // to rides in `_meta` alongside the other `_claude/*` keys. So does whether
+    // `size` is still the unconfirmed guess (`contextWindowAuthoritative` false,
+    // see `immediateContextWindow`): ACP requires a number, and a client must not
+    // show a guess as the session's limit.
     const attachUsageModel = <
       T extends {
         sessionUpdate: "usage_update";
@@ -3781,12 +3784,14 @@ export class ClaudeAcpAgent {
     >(
       update: T,
     ): T => {
-      if (!lastAssistantModel) return update;
+      const estimated = !session.contextWindowAuthoritative;
+      if (!lastAssistantModel && !estimated) return update;
       return {
         ...update,
         _meta: {
           ...(update._meta ?? {}),
-          "_claude/model": lastAssistantModel,
+          ...(lastAssistantModel ? { "_claude/model": lastAssistantModel } : {}),
+          ...(estimated ? { "_claude/contextWindowEstimated": true } : {}),
         },
       };
     };
diff --git a/src/tests/acp-agent.test.ts b/src/tests/acp-agent.test.ts
index e237076..20bd39c 100644
--- a/src/tests/acp-agent.test.ts
+++ b/src/tests/acp-agent.test.ts
@@ -10535,6 +10535,89 @@ describe("usage_update computation", () => {
     expect(usageUpdates[1].update.cost).toBeDefined();
   });
 
+  it("marks the guessed window until a result confirms it", async () => {
